WEBVTT

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:03.987
Welcome to this short video
that will present some tips and

00:00:03.987 --> 00:00:07.882
tricks for the Lofreq Ariga
with a protective sleeve.

00:00:07.882 --> 00:00:11.082
For instructions on how to perform
interbitten catheterization,

00:00:11.082 --> 00:00:13.722
please go to the step by
step instruction video or the

00:00:13.722 --> 00:00:17.477
instructions for use
provided in your product box.

00:00:17.477 --> 00:00:25.612
The catheter comes with some
features that are good to know.

00:00:25.612 --> 00:00:28.972
First, you need to break the sachet
to release the salt solution and

00:00:28.972 --> 00:00:30.412
activate the catheter.

00:00:30.412 --> 00:00:32.757
There are different ways to
break the sachet that are not

00:00:32.757 --> 00:00:35.077
shown in the
instructions for use.

00:00:35.077 --> 00:00:38.357
You might want to try to press it
between the palms of your hands.

00:00:38.357 --> 00:00:41.272
Or you can place the catheter
on a hard surface and break the

00:00:41.272 --> 00:00:43.352
sachet with your elbow.

00:00:43.352 --> 00:00:47.192
You can always elaborate to find a
way that suits you and your needs.

00:00:47.192 --> 00:00:49.957
The Lofreq Arrigo with a
protective sleeve has a loop

00:00:49.957 --> 00:00:53.157
for easier opening
of the package.

00:00:53.157 --> 00:00:55.237
When removing the
catheter from the package,

00:00:55.237 --> 00:00:57.932
gently pinch by the sleeve
grip and the sleeve will

00:00:57.932 --> 00:01:03.692
automatically expand over the catheter
tube when taking out the catheter.

00:01:03.692 --> 00:01:05.987
Or you can expand the
protective sleeve over the

00:01:05.987 --> 00:01:09.907
catheter tube after you've taken
the catheter out of the package.

00:01:09.907 --> 00:01:12.202
The catheter is now
ready to be used.

00:01:12.202 --> 00:01:14.922
Always make sure you follow the
advice and instructions given

00:01:14.922 --> 00:01:17.962
by your clinician which is
based on individual medical and

00:01:17.962 --> 00:01:19.597
lifestyle needs.

00:01:19.597 --> 00:01:25.437
Remember, Lofric Arigo is a urinary
catheter designed to be used only once.

00:01:25.437 --> 00:01:29.232
Lofric Arigo is ready for you
whatever your lifestyle needs.

00:01:29.232 --> 00:01:42.253
User friendly and safe and
easily folded to pocket size.
